# Rarimo Configuration #
########################
# Rarimo Network Configuration
RARIMO_MAINNET_RPC_URL="https://l2.rarimo.com"

# Rarimo - Deployed Contract Addresses on Rarimo Mainnet (ref: https://docs.rarimo.com/zk-passport/contracts/#deployments)
